            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A user apparatus in a communication system comprising the user apparatus and a base station including a plurality of TRPs being Transmission Reception Points configured to wirelessly communicate with the user apparatus, wherein the user apparatus includes a second time for switching a TRP into a first time from receiving a PDCCH order to transmitting a PRACH.</p>
